**`icu5000_pipeline.py`** (agent workdir root) — a replayable pipeline that reads only `raw/{hosp,icu,ecg,note}` and writes the 13-csv ICU5000 package. `submission.json` → `schema_version=1`, `result_root="."`, `replay.argv=["python3","icu5000_pipeline.py","--raw_root","{raw_root}","--output_dir","{output_dir}"]`.

## Error patterns derived from train raw↔reference diffing (19 rules, `train_analysis.json`)

| id | defect (train evidence) | repair |
|---|---|---|
| E1 | `icustays.outtime` shifted 1 h before `intime` (10/10) | rebuild `outtime = intime + round(los*86400)` |
| E2 | `hospital_expire_flag` inverted (7/7) | re-derive `1 iff deathtime` |
| E3 | `insurance` blanked | no source in raw → prior `Medicare` |
| E4/E5 | `gender`→`UNKNOWN_GENDER_CODE`, `anchor_age`→999, patients row missing for a cohort subject | sex from the clean discharge note (`Sex: M/F`), demographics built from the cohort subject list |
| E6 | `icd_code` prefixed `ALIAS_` (172/172) | strip prefix |
| E7 | `labs.valueuom` = `N/A` (91 rows) | → empty |
| E8 | 1090 label-leakage rows (`itemid=999001`, value `(insert)`) | drop |
| E9 | itemid alias `992{2,3}XXXX` (900 rows / 324 ids) | resolve by 4-digit suffix against the itemids present |
| E10 | `stay_id` prefixed `9` (942 rows) | strip prefix |
| E11 | 1970 exact duplicate rows | dedup **after** all cell repairs |
| E12 | `charttime` overwritten with `outtime+1day` (1217 rows) | restore from neighbouring rows in the (charttime-ordered) file |
| E13 | `valuenum` ×100 scale / placeholder codes | per-`(itemid,value)` mode + numeric `value` text |
| E14 | MIMIC native errors (20 cells) | patient/item median of usable readings (computed last) |
| E15–E17 | `inputevents.hadm_id` mismatch, `endtime` inverted, `amount` placeholder | hadm from stay map; endtime from ingredient events (`orderid`) → **2668/2668 exact**; amount = original amount / rate×duration |
| E18 | `outputevents.charttime` = epoch (445 rows) | hour of `storetime` (198/445 recoverable) |
| E19 | ECG studies of one subject absent from the raw slice | unrecoverable |

